{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/Sup_Nerd.gif?t=1745996644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/Crit.gif?t=1745996644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Katana Punk is a roguelike deck builder set in a neon-lit dystopian Tokyo, about discovering game-breaking synergies.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/Choose_Relic.gif?t=1745996644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/Break_game_or_die.gif?t=1745996644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Take a weak card. Modify it, re-write it's effects,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it hits three times. Now it refunds mana when it crits. Now it hits multiple enemies<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/Map.gif?t=1745996644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This city contains secret alleyways you can't see, break down fake walls and sometimes you'll find some food vendors, and sometimes you'll skips half the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ cards</strong>, every single one can mutate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ card mods</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ passive \u201cTreasures\u201d</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Level\u00a03 tier</strong> once per run, one lucky card gets a chance to be upgraded to Level 3.<br>*\u00a0Example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a01</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a010 damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a02</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a020 damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a03 (once per run)</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a0<strong>100</strong> damage.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/craft.gif?t=1745996644\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1741870?t=1745996644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1741870?t=1745996644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/ec9ad75d6ed1347f491ffcbbaf661b75a55ac90c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745996644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/ec9ad75d6ed1347f491ffcbbaf661b75a55ac90c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745996644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Violence: Includes visual effects such as blood splatter when enemies are struck, bloodied weapons, and implied character death or murder.\r\n\r\nSuggestive Themes: One of the debuffs the game uses features an anime \"ahego face\". It's a close-up with no nudity, and is limited to a single frame close-up.\r\n\r\n\r\nLanguage: The words \u201cf**k\u201d and \u201csh*t\u201d are used quite liberally."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/Sup_Nerd.gif?t=1745996644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/Crit.gif?t=1745996644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Katana Pu